{{Quote|Machines, Icegirls, Berserkers, Babies, Demons... and even a Nurse thrown in there for good measure! It's the ragtag group of no-goodniks known as the famous Dynamites! Run, don't walk, to the Rare Capsule Machine to collect these modern Uber Rare wonders!|[[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]]' announcement}}
'''THE DYNAMITES''' (超激ダイナマイツ chō geki dainamaitsu, ''Lit. '''Super Super Dynamites''''') is one of the first [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] events in The Battle Cats. This event was implemented on November 30th, 2013 with initially 5 characters. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.5 Update|Version 2.0.5]]. Ubers in this set have a cheap price & fast recharge compared to other Uber Rares and generally have more disposability. Most of the cats here are thematically based off video game tropes or characters from other video games. The most recent Uber is [[Akane Tounji (Uber Rare Cat)|Akane Tounji]], added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]].

To unlock this banner in [[The Battle Cats Unite!|The Battle Cats Unite]], one has to clear [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]] in the '''Japanese''' ('''JP''') and '''International''' ('''WW''') versions and [[Greece (Empire of Cats)|Greece]] in the '''Southeast Asia''' ('''SEA''') version.

