==Trivia==
*This is the second Rare Cat Capsule event ever in the game, after [[Tales of the Nekoluga (Gacha Event)|Tales of the Nekoluga]].
*In the event poster for THE DYNAMITES, Lasvoss is accompanied by the phrase, "My servant, I grant thee rule over 1/3 of this world!" This is a reference to part of a quote from the main antagonist of the original ''Dragon Quest'', the [https://dragon-quest.org/wiki/Dragonlord Dragonlord]: "Take thy rightful place at my side! Do so, and I will grant unto thee dominion over half the world!"
*In the [http://www.ponos.co.jp/iphone/jp/appli/battlecats/event/dynamites.html Japanese event poster] for THE DYNAMITES, [[Cat Machine (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Machine]] is accompanied by the phrase, "こいつ…動くにゃ！" (Koitsu... ugoku nya!). This is a reference to a [https://youtu.be/kCYDSlQgeG8 famous line] from the first episode of ''''[[wikipedia:Mobile Suit Gundam|Mobile Suit Gundam]]'', "こいつ…動くぞ！" (Koitsu... ugoku zo!), which means "This guy... moves!" The line is used as one's reaction when something they weren't expecting to move, starts moving.

